; Great House Farm / Tŷ Mawr — public accounts (allied camp)
; Plain-text double-entry ledger (Beancount). Compiled from receipts on file.
; Only case- and project-related spending is published. Personal spending is left out.
; Amounts in GBP. USD receipts are converted at ~0.75 GBP per USD (an estimate; marked fx: "~") unless the receipt states a GBP amount.
; Each entry carries an evidence reference (R-nnn). The receipts themselves are kept privately and are not published.

